              "value": "Requirements: The gau cho rong is hiding and a creature that hasn't detected it is within 20 feet\n\nThe gau cho rong Strides toward the creature. Once the creature is in reach, the gau cho rong makes a Strike against it. The target creature is off-guard to this attack."
