        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Devour"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The gau cho rong's last action was a successful jaws Strike\n\nThe target takes 1d6 persistent bleed damage. The gau cho rong gains some knowledge from the creature's blood, learning how to understand and speak all languages that creature knows for 1 minute, which it does in a distorted version of the target's voice. During that time, the gau cho rong also gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Intimidation checks to Demoralize that creature."
